          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="More frequent maritime harassment raises insurance and trade‑finance costs and prompts exporters, importers and portfolio investors to delay, reroute or withdraw exposures to the corridor and nearby markets, reducing net cross‑border capital flows to and through those jurisdictions." />
