          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="An acceleration in AI capital spending by major firms drives outbound FDI and cross-border project financing (cloud regions, hyperscale campuses, equipment purchases), producing measurable increases in net cross-border capital flows as funds are deployed abroad." />
