          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Large spikes in financial volatility raise risk premia and trigger margin calls and forced position adjustments in commodity futures markets, producing short-covering and liquidity-driven jumps in spot oil and gas prices." />
